From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:20:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 217/220] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on browser
 snapshots and off-screen screenshots

Review fixes for the previous patch. A capture now checks that the registry
still holds the same entry, so a chat closed (or closed and reopened) during a
queued or staged capture is never staged or left attached. When the chat
becomes active mid-capture the staging position is undone before resync,
which applies nothing until the pane has sent bounds. The retry loop runs on
one clock, so slow empty paints share the 10 s budget instead of looping for
minutes. The snapshot no longer enters a visibility:hidden frame's document,
enters at most 3 nested frames, and stops at 2000 lines or 50000 visited
elements with a truncation note.
